{"4061310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Deafening", "steam_appid": 4061310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Deafening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a relentless horror nightmare where <strong>every decision could be your last</strong>. In <i>The Deafening</i>, you won’t just fight for survival, you’ll need to <strong>study your enemies, plan your moves, and outsmart your foes</strong>. Even when you think you’ve grown strong, a single mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/8177984e10ae01a5d075bf6b2bc4dfcb.poster.avif?t=1785292625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/8177984e10ae01a5d075bf6b2bc4dfcb.webm?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/8177984e10ae01a5d075bf6b2bc4dfcb.mp4?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Careful Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of <strong>essential items</strong>, but they’re heavy and your carrying capacity is limited. Choosing what to take, and what to leave behind, can mean the difference between life and death. Return for forgotten items at your own risk, as every trip exposes you to new dangers and unexpected horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/74db4a8b1a4c53aad38d97eaa433a348.poster.avif?t=1785292625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/74db4a8b1a4c53aad38d97eaa433a348.webm?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/74db4a8b1a4c53aad38d97eaa433a348.mp4?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wits and Guts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from <strong>notes, careful observation, and experience</strong>, and rely on strategy and cunning to survive. Every encounter, every decision, and every item matters in this <strong>tense, immersive survival-horror experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/e2d05dcee4598a9059711ca1b180a4c7.poster.avif?t=1785292625\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/e2d05dcee4598a9059711ca1b180a4c7.webm?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061310/extras/e2d05dcee4598a9059711ca1b180a4c7.mp4?t=1785292625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Deafening</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a relentless horror nightmare where <strong>every decision could be your last</strong>. In <i>The Deafening</i>, you won’t just fight for survival, you’ll need to <strong>study your enemies, plan your moves, and outsmart your foes</strong>. Even when you think you’ve grown strong, a single mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co